{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"mineshaft_t3","model_identifier":"mineshaft_t3","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# mineshaft_t3\n\nMineshaft tier 3: a stone engine-house with a big winding wheel on a tall head-frame, rails running out of the shaft with an ore cart.\n\n- Footprint: 12 x 10 columns (192 x 160 units, 5.40 x 4.50 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -70..96, y 0..172, z -92..70 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 79, construction_0 27, construction_33 48, construction_66 71, ruined 24 (7 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- head-frame: 32 x 152 x 32 centred at the origin\n- engine house: 60 x 170 x 76 at x 64, z 4\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `mineshaft_t3_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `mineshaft_t3_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_mineshaft_t3` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 3.0 | loop | `winding_wheel` turns once per 3 s. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -24)\n- `fx_smoke` at (80, 173, 30)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (0, 0, -96)\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"collar","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-18.0,0.0,-18.0],"to":[18.0,4.0,18.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,353.0,36.0,357.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,353.0,36.0,357.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,353.0,36.0,357.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.0,353.0,36.0,357.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[44.0,266.0,80.0,302.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[44.0,266.0,80.0,302.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"aa89d4d4-574a-5a93-bf36-ca6ce6487a98"},{"name":"shaft","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-14.0,0.0,-14.0],"to":[14.0,4.2,14.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[164.0,338.8,192.0,343.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[164.0,338.8,192.0,343.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[164.0,338.8,192.0,343.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[164.0,338.8,192.0,343.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[132.0,266.0,160.0,294.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[132.0,266.0,160.0,294.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"0555a741-9b81-58d6-9130-6247625abb8e"},{"name":"hf_leg0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-16.0,4.0,-16.0],"to":[-12.0,110.0,-12.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[16.0,0.0,20.0,106.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[16.0,0.0,20.0,106.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[16.0,0.0,20.0,106.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[16.0,0.0,20.0,106.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[66.0,361.0,70.0,365.0],"textu